I was trying to fix a cursed bag of holding that I found in a bones pile,
and found that I couldn't even read a scroll of remove curse. 

After some wizmode testing, I learned that any attempts to read scrolls
are blocked, and also that attempting to cast remove curse fails when
overtaxed. This leaves #dipping as the only means of uncursing a cursed
bag of holding with sufficient contents. (In my test case I used 100
daggers.)

Is this an intended effect, or should exceptions be written into the
weight check code for remove curse?

